<section class="section dark-section faq">
  <div class="container faq-container">
    <span class="section-label light">Common Questions</span>
    <h2>FAQ</h2>

    <div class="faq-list faq-list-light">

      <div class="faq-item faq-item-light">
        <button class="faq-question faq-question-light" aria-expanded="false">What is cold water immersion therapy?</button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">Cold water immersion therapy involves submerging your body in cold water &mdash; typically between 39&deg;F and 55&deg;F &mdash; for a short period. It triggers a physiological stress response that, over time, improves circulation, reduces inflammation, accelerates muscle recovery, boosts energy, and builds mental resilience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item faq-item-light">
        <button class="faq-question faq-question-light" aria-expanded="false">Who is cold therapy for?</button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">Cold therapy is used by athletes, fitness enthusiasts, wellness-focused individuals, and anyone looking to improve recovery and daily energy. Both our residential and commercial units are designed for regular use by healthy adults. If you have a medical condition, consult your doctor before starting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item faq-item-light">
        <button class="faq-question faq-question-light" aria-expanded="false">How cold do PlungeZero units actually get?</button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">PlungeZero systems can cool water down to approximately 39&deg;F (4&deg;C), well within the optimal range for cold water immersion therapy. The built-in chiller maintains a consistent temperature so you get the same experience every session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item faq-item-light">
        <button class="faq-question faq-question-light" aria-expanded="false">How difficult is setup?</button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">Super easy! Just plug the unit into a standard outlet - no special electrical work or plumbing required. Fill it with water, set your temperature, and you're ready to plunge.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="section-cta" style="margin-top:48px; border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding-top:40px;">
      <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,30px); font-weight:900; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.03em; margin-bottom:10px;">Still Have Questions?</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:15px; margin-bottom:24px;">Head to our full <a href="/pages/faq" style="color:var(--accent);">FAQ page</a> or reach out to our team directly.</p>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-outline-light">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/pages/faq" class="btn btn-primary">View All FAQs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ Section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
